> Is this mapped correctly onto the proto values? "stringValue" vs. string string_value = 6;

The conversion from `snake_case` to `lowerCamelCase` is done automagically for protobufs depending on the conventions of the language, so the mapping here is correct. 

I think a change may have recently gone in to fix this that'll be released in the next version. @AnOctopus can confirm whether this is the case.
